<http://data.silknow.org/event/079ffc9b-72d7-32cd-be2f-32aec5961521>
        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Sleeveless cloak probably worn by Henry Irving as Philip Vanderdecken in Percy Fitzgerald & W G Wills' play 'Vanderdecken' performed at the Lyceum Theatre, London, 8th June 1878.  The play was based on the legend of the Flying Dutchman.  The scenery was designed by Hawes Craven."@en ;
        ecrm:P22_transferred_title_to  <http://data.silknow.org/actor/f0577f91-f887-3019-bf88-f9e5ba019390> ;
        ecrm:P24_transferred_title_of  <http://data.silknow.org/object/8c90ca52-39bb-3431-be52-7be08c47215d> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Sleeveless cloak probably worn by Henry Irving as Philip Vanderdecken in Percy Fitzgerald & W G Wills' play 'Vanderdecken' performed at the Lyceum Theatre, London, 8th June 1878.  The play was based on the legend of the Flying Dutchman.  The scenery was designed by Hawes Craven."@en .

